# An agent-only image has no role selector, so its agent starts at boot.
#
# Stated explicitly rather than left to the distribution's default-enable
# fallthrough: this is the behaviour the image depends on, and a policy that
# holds only because nothing contradicts it is one upstream package change away
# from silently reversing.
#
# On the unified CPU image eks-server's 40- file sorts first and disables this
# unit instead, leaving the choice to the first-boot selector.
enable k3s-agent.service
